WEBVTT

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.580
Da fuck you say?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.620
You <i>do </i>realize who the
fuck you're talkin' to, don't cha?

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.200
Yes, b-but...

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.750
Startin' today, this area
belongs to us, the Binzui-gumi!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.250
Hey, you fuckin' maggots.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:43.830
Huh? Well, well, if it ain't Mr. Samatoki Aohitsugi,
<i>wakagashira </i>of the Katen-gumi.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.790
Our syndicate'll be callin' the shots here now.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.500
I'll fuckin' crush you!

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.660
We'll slaughter ya!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.040
"Chinatown"

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.830
Don't you ever set foot
on my turf again, asshole!

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.790
Damn it!

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.000
Um, thank you so much.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.450
If those punks ever show up again,
you let me know.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:31.790
Yokohama... a lawless division where
the nightlife district's unchecked desires

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.910
coexist with the port town scenery.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:41.000
In this town, there's no
such thing as an uneventful day.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.290
If something unusual happens every day,
it becomes ordinary.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.540
Today's just the start of another shitty day.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.660
While I know it's business as usual for you,
don't go making a ruckus about town.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.950
Think of how you'd feel if it were
you hushing everything up instead of me.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.080
Like I give a rat's ass about your situation.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.660
Samatoki... that's not very commendable.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.290
What the hell's your problem?

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.620
Are you givin' me the same crap
as this fuckin' rabbity-ass cop?

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:45.910
No, your response to this invasion
of your territory has been too careless.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:50.370
First, you must strengthen the defenses
of your key bases and maintain them.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.540
When a large number of enemy troops
advances on you, you can maintain

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.910
the upper hand on the battlefield as long
as your key bases are absolutely secure.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:00.040
Rio, please don't do anything
to get this fool keyed up.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:04.660
What?! Who the fuck are you callin' a fool?!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:08.830
I'm saying that this impulsive
streak of yours is foolish.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.540
Why you little!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.450
Break it up, you two!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.120
I was only trying to give you
my calm and practical advice.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:21.830
Still, you have a tendency to think
little of your key bases, Samatoki.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.910
That may become a big problem
for you in the future.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.500
You mustn't...

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.950
Kashira, sorry to interrupt your meeting.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.290
What do you want, Rentei?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:40.000
It seems that the Binzui-gumi has been
stirring up trouble in Chinatown lately.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.160
Those guys? I already made
short work out of them.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.700
That's just like you, Kashira. You're so quick.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:47.950
Aw, shucks.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.120
Gennou Nouzenkazura is after you, Wakagashira,

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:54.120
and seems to be trying to take over our turf.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.410
What shall we do?

00:04:55.410 --> 00:05:00.200
Gennou, that fuckin' prick. Next time
he tries somethin', we'll fuckin' waste him.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.830
So, you said you had something
to wanted to talk about?

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:06.910
Yeah... but first, would you ask him to leave?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.370
Step outside.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.500
Certainly.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.750
Rentei, today's your
kid sister's birthday, isn't it?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.870
Yes, it is.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.620
Buy her something nice.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.410
She's the only family you've got, right?

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.000
Gotta take good care of your family.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.500
Thank you.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:37.200
The Binzui-gumi has a casino on your turf.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.160
What, a casino?!
That's the first I've heard of it!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.870
Settle down and let me finish.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:42.790
Tsk...

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:47.000
There's going to be a major drug
deal going down there tonight.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.500
Whoever can thwart this would
inflict major damage on the Binzui-gumi.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:56.790
I appreciate the tip, but why don't
you get the cops to act on it?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.370
I want to rid the world of drugs.

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:04.830
In order to do that I need to rise
within the ranks of the police force.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.250
You've got that right.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.750
And in order to advance I've got
to pull off an extraordinary achievement.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.290
I see.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.410
So, you're going to enlist
the help of the two of us

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.580
and make it look to the police like
you pulled it off single-handedly.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.450
Well, that's it in a nutshell.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:23.000
Hmph, I can't stand being played like a fiddle,

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.750
but if it involves the Binzui-gumi...

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.290
All right, I'm in!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.160
I'll assist you as well.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.330
As a serviceman I cannot turn a blind eye
to those who would disturb the peace.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.330
I thought you guys would say that.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.870
"Binzui"

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.450
Oh, yeah?

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:49.450
Great work. That deal is
one of our major rackets, you know.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:49.700
Heh heh hehehehehe...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.620
"Binzui-gumi"

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.620
Heh heh hehehehehe...

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:10.750
What is up with this guy, anyway?
He's been gambling non-stop since this morning.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:16.290
Yeah, he built up his war chest
playing pachinko and the ponies

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.450
and came to this illegal casino
to top it all off. The man's a lost cause.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.290
There's no need for us
to keep watching him, is there?

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:28.120
You're right. Let's call it quits and head
over to where MAD TRIGGER CREW is.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.080
C'mon, Tom, we're leaving.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:34.040
Hey, let a guy take his time and enjoy his meal.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.620
Huh?!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.790
What are you doing? We're running out of time.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.950
Yeah, I know.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.200
Tsk. So, this is your plan?!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:50.500
Just put up with it. They'll catch
onto us unless we're camouflaged.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:55.950
But do you really think a deal's
goin' down in a place as well-lit as this?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:08:01.370
Yeah, no doubt about it.
The deal will go down behind that door.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.330
So, we've got to keep our eyes
on it while playing a game or two,

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.750
just so they won't get suspicious.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.000
All right.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.540
A hundred grand on 3.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.700
No more bets.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.370
Wow!

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:21.660
3.6 mil? That's too much of a win!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.330
Rio, it's not wise to stand out too much...

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.540
I have completed many infiltration missions.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:31.040
It's no trouble for me
to blend in at places like this.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.370
I hate to say it, but you're sticking out
like a sore thumb instead...

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.910
Ugyahhhhh!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:41.700
M-My entire life savings!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.790
That's one helluva noisy bastard.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:44.580
Huh?

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.540
I must also ask you to give us back
the advance we loaned you.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:50.700
Uwahhhhhn! I don't have a single yen on me!

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.870
Damn, this is not looking good.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.370
What if this turned into a big deal?

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:57.540
Allow me to cover his losses.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.910
Whoaaa!

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.540
Certainly, sir.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:07.330
Thank y--? Well, I'll be damned,
if it ain't you, Rio.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.580
What's with that get-up of y--?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.580
Shh!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.750
Keep it your voice down. I have
my reasons but can't get into them right now.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.410
Is he an acquaintance of yours?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:20.660
Affirmative. I once rescued poor Arisugawa
as he lay dying by the side of the road.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.910
Ever since then, he comes to eat my cooking.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.120
That's... rather bold of him.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.450
C'mon, c'mon, let's break it up now!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.370
Lemme borrow some dough from one of my buds,

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.580
so I can pay back what I owe you right now.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.200
Well, you don't have
to do it right this minute...

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:40.950
It's not like I get to see you that often,
Rio, so don't get all formal about it.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:45.040
Hey, hi, it's me! Uwah!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.660
Go do your yakkin' somewhere else!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:57.120
Hey, it's me! I'm in a bit of a bind here.
Could you spot me some cash?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.830
The same amount as before...

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.830
What? Don't say things like that!
C'mon, I'm begging you!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.250
--Huh?!
--Give me that!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:10.370
Your fuckin' pal here owes my associate big time!
Now fork over the dough!

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.700
Hey, is that you, Samatoki?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.830
Huh? Who the hell are you?

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:19.040
Ah haha! It's me, Ramuda!

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:22.370
Ramuda? What're you doin'...?

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:25.080
Dice is a member of my posse.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:28.290
Ramuda, did something
happen to Dice perchance?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:32.290
It sounds like he's in a big mess
because he owes people money.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.450
He never learns now, does he?

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:39.040
I don't care how you do it,
but he's your pal, so <i>do </i>somethin' about it!

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:44.660
Okay, I'll transfer the money, but that
means you owe me a favor now, Samatoki!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.160
--What the--?! Hey, hold on now,
I'm not done talkin' here!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:49.040
--Bye-bye!
--What the--?! Hey, hold on now,
I'm not done talkin' here!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.950
Why the fuck do I...?

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.750
What did Ramuda say?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.120
Hmph, Ramuda said he'd cover your debts.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.700
All right! I'm saved!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:02.870
So, you're one of the guys on Ramuda's team, eh?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:07.830
Yep. Alrighty then, tell Rio I said thanks!

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.000
Hmph.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.120
Anything happen?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.870
Samatoki...

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:20.410
Hey, aren't they...?

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.000
When did they enter the room?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.620
Probably before we got here.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.870
Let's follow them.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.160
Hey, you guys are...

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:42.700
Uryahhh!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:46.450
Looks like we were set up.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:49.910
These assholes have really
pulled out all the stops.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.790
Stand back, the both of you!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.040
Huh?! What do you m--?

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.080
Please, let me handle this.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.200
Why are you doing this?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.910
You know the answer.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:25.120
I won't let you get away!

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.410
God damn it!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:38.370
Damn, the end of the line...
Rio, you know these assholes?

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:42.870
Hmph.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.950
They knew our every move.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:49.160
You sayin' our plans were leaked?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:54.620
Let's call it a day. I'm going to have
to do some investigating into this.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:58.160
Yeah, you're right about that.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.160
"Binzui"

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.500
The deal went down without a hitch.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:08.830
Yeah, I've got other plans to take down Samatoki.
Stop by my office tomorrow.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.790
"Organized Crime Department"

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.580
"No Caller ID"

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:24.750
Yes.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:27.500
There's a rat inside the Katen-gumi.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:31.250
An informer. It figures. So, who is it?

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:31.500
I risked my neck to get you this intel, pal.
It's gonna cost you big.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.580
"Spy Inside  ̷P̷o̷l̷i̷c̷e̷ ̷D̷e̷p̷t̷?̷
Katen-gumi?"

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.580
I risked my neck to get you this intel, pal.
It's gonna cost you big.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.120
I risked my neck to get you this intel, pal.
It's gonna cost you big.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:43.450
With all the dirt I've got on you,
I could haul your ass in right now if need be.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:47.790
I-I was just messin' with ya. The rat is...

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:01.080
So glad you came.
Let's have something to eat first.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:08.120
R-Rio, I'm not that hungry right now,
so you needn't have bothered...

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.000
I see...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.580
He went to the trouble of making it,
dumbass, so we'd better eat it.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.250
Wouldya look at that forlorn mug of his?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.910
Oh...

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:23.910
Rio! I'll have some of that,
so don't clear it away.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:28.120
I-I guess I'll have some too, after all...

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:33.410
All right, dig in! I made plenty
of extra, so don't be shy!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:39.700
Now that we've eaten,
let's get down to business.

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:46.750
All right. Those guys who attacked us
last night used to be members of my unit.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.870
I contacted some of my
other connections and looked into it.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.410
These guys have teamed up with the Binzui-gumi,

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.750
and they're trying to seize your turf, Samatoki.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.160
What do you mean?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.950
These guys were members
of my unit's science squad.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:02.660
They've been using controlled substances

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:06.410
to create a new type of drug and are dealing it.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:10.370
So, they want to seize your turf
to increase the market for their drug.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.040
Why the fuck are they doin' that?

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:16.500
I suspect they are of the same mind as me.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.290
And that is...?

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.580
They want to rescue the lieutenant commander.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.410
The lieutenant commander?

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.000
The unit I was assigned to had performed

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:30.370
many illegal acts for the sake of lasting peace.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:34.160
Before I knew it, my spirit had been worn away.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.370
The lieutenant commander was
the one who came to my rescue.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.790
Where is he now?

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.620
He's in the Special Prison.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.870
The place that holds members
of the previous administration

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.370
who were taken prisoner in the last coup d'état.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.540
Affirmative. Having been
defeated in the battle with Chuohku,

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:55.830
the entire unit was to be arrested as war criminals,

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.370
but he circumvented
that by being apprehended.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:06.910
That's why the people in my unit all
want to rescue the lieutenant commander.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.870
However, I cannot turn a blind eye
to my fellow servicemen

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:12.200
who would succumb to evil
to achieve their objectives.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.790
That's not what the lieutenant commander
would have wanted either.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.660
I also have something to discuss.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:29.000
What the fuck did you say?
I'll fuckin' kill those dung beetles!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.160
Leave this in Samatoki Aohitsugi's
office and rat on him to the cops.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:34.160
"Binzui-gumi"

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:34.160
Leave this in Samatoki Aohitsugi's
office and rat on him to the cops.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.830
If you do that, we can rid
ourselves of that nuisance,

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.620
and grabbing the
Katen-gumi's turf'll be a breeze.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:47.330
And then I'll give you your
kid sister back safe and sound.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:50.950
Why, it'll happen just as soon
as this matter is settled.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:57.080
All right, don't you dare
lay a finger on my sister.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.660
W-We're fucked!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.000
What's all the fuss about?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.580
W-Well-- Gwah!

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:05.870
Why, you!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:10.700
Time to get exterminated, you pests!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:14.290
Kashira! F-Forgive me!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.450
I told you, didn't I?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.580
Huh?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.620
You gotta take good care of your family.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.120
Kashira...

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.580
Why are you doing this?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.660
It wouldn't please the lieutenant
commander to know you teamed up

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:27.330
with these bastards to rescue him.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.370
Our methods don't matter.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:34.040
We'll do whatever it takes to free him.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:39.000
Even if it breaks the law.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.000
One cannot achieve a noble cause
by paying mere lip service to it.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.290
So, we have swallowed our pride.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.950
Without pride, a noble cause has no meaning.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:49.660
Your methods are flawed.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:54.160
Our positions are incompatible.
Further dialogue with you is a waste of our time.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:18:00.040
It's foolish of you to make a suicide run
on our headquarters with your numbers.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.080
And we've got ourselves a hostage to boot.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:05.830
You guys are pure trash.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:11.330
We'll fuckin' pummel you 10 million times
over before you make your first move!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.950
You don't say!

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:16.000
I'd like to see you try it!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.200
♬ Yo, fuck off, get outta here ♬

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.370
♬ You bastards preying on the weak's fears ♬

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.700
♬ Got some balls to be around me here ♬

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.580
♬ Piss off, this is Yokohama ♬

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.790
♬ I'll beat it into you as a threat ♬

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.370
♬ If you can't remember, then don't forget ♬

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.950
♬ A line you can't cross ♬

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.950
♬ And for those that do, sentenced to death! ♬

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.870
♬ Like moths to a flame ♬

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.790
♬ Evil tries to get free
but traps them all the same ♬

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.000
♬ No escaping from this net for these thugs ♬

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.580
♬ Rounding up the gang and their drugs ♬

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.330
♬ All excuses are denied ♬

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.540
♬ Extenuating circumstances cannot be applied ♬

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.540
♬ My ties to you left on the wayside ♬

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.200
♬ as a stepping stone in my career ♬

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.370
♬ Today's comrades sharing a meal ♬

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.540
♬ are foes tomorrow locked in an ordeal ♬

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.750
♬ A warped sense of justice
and outrage they feel ♬

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.870
♬ I'll issue a manifesto and scold you ♬

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.830
♬ Your ego disgusts me ♬

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.000
♬ What do you see ♬

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.160
♬ in selling your soul to the devil for victory? ♬

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.700
♬ Checkmate, your King taken so easily ♬

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.000
♬ Hama's dangerous trigger coming into play ♬

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.080
♬ We ain't messing around, outta the way ♬

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.410
♬ We ain't joking around, bullets are gonna spray ♬

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.450
♬ Don't test da master ♬

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:41.700
♬ Hama's dangerous trigger coming into play ♬

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.790
♬ We ain't messing around, outta the way ♬

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:46.160
♬ We ain't joking around, bullets are gonna spray ♬

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.910
♬ Don't test da master ♬

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.500
And keep sinking. Forever and ever.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.500
I will free the lieutenant commander.
Just you wait.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.450
My dear brother!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.700
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.950
Please forgive me for what I've done.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.790
Rentei, you're expelled from the family.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.790
Kashira!

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.790
Get out of my sight.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.040
You okay with that?

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:51.160
Yeah, he isn't cut out for this world.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:59.250
Kid sister, huh.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.290
My dear brother!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.370
Nemu...

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:12.830
Thanks to you, I can score some major
career-advancing points this time around.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:17.410
Hmph. I guess that means you owe me big time.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.200
What are you talking about?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.200
With this incident,

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.950
I can hold the Binzui-gumi's
<i>kumicho </i>under employers' liability.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.950
That's wonderful news for you, isn't it?

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.620
Tsk...

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:32.410
I must apologize to both of you.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:35.250
My fellow servicemen caused
you a great deal of trouble.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:41.500
Don't go apologizin' to us.
This was our problem. Ain't that right, Jyuto?

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:47.330
Yeah, that's right. Plus, it made for some
great practice for the division battle.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.080
Yeah, at this rate we'll
make it to the top in no time.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:56.620
Affirmative. If I make it to the finals,
I'll be able to get inside Chuohku.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.620
Then I'll be able to get some intel
on the lieutenant commander.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:07.370
Certainly. We've got to keep on winning
in order to accomplish my goals as well.

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:11.580
Heh. Okay, guys,
show me you've got what it takes.

00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:20.200
Just you wait, Ichiro.
